  "worked_solution": "Using the vector space axioms, we obtain the following: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}0x & =0x &  & [\\,\\text{given}\\,] \\\\ (0+0)x & =0x &  & [\\,\\text{property of number\u00a0}0\\,] \\\\ 0x+0x & =0x &  & [\\,\\text{axiom\u00a0}\\text{A7}\\,] \\\\ (0x+0x)+(-0x) & =0x+(-0x) &  & [\\,\\text{add\u00a0}-0x\\text{\u00a0to both sides}\\,] \\\\ (0x+0x)+(-0x) & =0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom A4}\\,] \\\\ 0x+(0x+(-0x)) & =0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom A2}\\,] \\\\ 0x+0 & =0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom A4}\\,] \\\\ 0x & =0 &  & [\\,\\text{axiom\u00a0}\\text{A3}\\,]\\end{aligned}\n$$",
